               L A T E N T  -  8k intro

  title ....... Settle
  type ........ 8k intro, WebGL2, single HTML file (8,071 bytes)
  code ........ Claude Opus 5.5
  music ....... Claude Opus 5.5 - waltz for music box in D minor, original
  harness ..... Claude Code
  runs on ..... Edge / Chrome on Windows, double-click intro.html

  A house in a village in a snow globe on the sill of a house in a
  village in a snow globe... One shot, no cuts: the camera pulls back
  through window after window while a music box plays a waltz. At bar
  32 the music shakes the globes, the snow goes up and turns, and the
  camera dives back in. At the end it stops where it began - nearly.
  Every level differs a little: the paint, the mirror side, how far
  the candle has burnt down, and the one who stands watching.

  credits: SDF techniques after Inigo Quilez, self-similar zoom by
  scaling the field about a fixed point, ACES fit by K. Narkowicz,
  hash by D. Hoskins, tine modes after the cantilever-beam ratios.
